# Test fixtures are byte-sensitive inputs to a content-addressed pipeline:
# `source_sha256` is the SHA-256 of the raw report file, so a checkout that
# rewrote line endings would give the same fixture a different identity on a
# different machine. `fragment_id` is canonical and unaffected, but pinning the
# bytes keeps the two from diverging for a confusing reason.
tests/fixtures/** -text
